  <h2>Common Questions</h2>

  <p><strong>How do I delete my account?</strong></p>
  <p>Open the app, go to Settings, and look for the account deletion option. This permanently removes your profile and unlinks your identity from your activity going forward.</p>

  <p><strong>How do I manage or cancel my subscription?</strong></p>
  <p>Subscriptions are managed directly through your Apple ID account settings (Settings app &rarr; your name &rarr; Subscriptions), not within Haunts itself. Apple handles all billing directly.</p>

  <p><strong>How do I report inappropriate content or another user?</strong></p>
  <p>Tap on the content or user in question and use the built-in report or block option. You can also contact us directly using the email above.</p>

  <p><strong>Something isn't working right, what do I do?</strong></p>
  <p>Email us at the address above with a description of what happened, and your device type if relevant, we'll look into it.</p>

